        "accession_number": "0001533232-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Our approach to sustainability is a key part of how we conduct our business as an investor, developer, owner and operator of one of the world’s largest publicly traded platforms for renewable power and sustainable solutions.",
        "start_character": 137242,
        "end_character": 137466
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001533232-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001533232-26-000011-acdd6524ef9ed031",
        "accession_number": "0001533232-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To grow Brookfield Renewable, we maintain a proactive and focused business development program in each of our core markets, augmented by access to Brookfield’s global investment platform that may lead to originating attractive opportunities for investment.",
        "start_character": 108306,
        "end_character": 108562
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001533232-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001533232-26-000011-acdd6524ef9ed031",
        "accession_number": "0001533232-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To support this, we have set a specific target for adding clean energy capacity: from 2022 develop an additional 21,000 MW of new clean energy capacity by 2030, which would represent a doubling of our operating portfolio to 42,000 MW.",
        "start_character": 141401,
        "end_character": 141635
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001533232-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001533232-26-000011-acdd6524ef9ed031",
        "accession_number": "0001533232-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are committed to responsible environmental and social practices that strengthen our resilience, manage risk, and support long-term value creation for our business.",
        "start_character": 29425,
        "end_character": 29591
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001533232-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001533232-26-000011-acdd6524ef9ed031",
        "accession_number": "0001533232-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We are focused on maintaining the cost competitive position of our portfolio through disciplined management of operating costs.",
        "start_character": 29852,
        "end_character": 29979
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001533232-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001533232-26-000011-acdd6524ef9ed031",
        "accession_number": "0001533232-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We continue to scale our development activities and grow our business through project development.",
        "start_character": 109216,
        "end_character": 109314
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001533232-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001533232-26-000011-acdd6524ef9ed031",
        "accession_number": "0001533232-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "While we expect to have a strong weighting to hydroelectric generation going forward given our large existing portfolio, we intend to continue to acquire and develop assets using other renewable power technologies that share similar fundamental characteristics to our hydroelectric portfolio of long-life, predictable operating costs and cash flows, and sustainable competitive cost advantages.",
        "start_character": 109716,
        "end_character": 110110
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001533232-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001533232-26-000011-acdd6524ef9ed031",
        "accession_number": "0001533232-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•Growth: We benefit from the strategic advice, transaction origination capabilities and corporate development services of the Service Provider to grow our business.",
        "start_character": 131099,
        "end_character": 131263
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001533232-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001533232-26-000011-acdd6524ef9ed031",
        "accession_number": "0001533232-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "•Materiality: We conduct regular materiality assessments, taking a double-materiality approach, defining material sustainability considerations as those with the potential to significantly impact our business, the natural environment where we operate, and our stakeholders, including our people and the communities where we operate.",
        "start_character": 137890,
        "end_character": 138222
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001533232-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001533232-26-000011-acdd6524ef9ed031",
        "accession_number": "0001533232-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Because of our extensive development expertise we believe we are well positioned to evaluate and ultimately acquire and develop these projects.",
        "start_character": 98404,
        "end_character": 98547
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001533232-26-000011",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001533232-26-000011-acdd6524ef9ed031",
        "accession_number": "0001533232-26-000011",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-27",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Federal refundable investment tax credits are now largely available, and will continue to promote capital investments in electricity generation systems across several technologies including hydro, wind, solar and storage, which we expect to have a positive impact on the commercial viability and competitiveness of our development projects.",
